From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Subject: [PATCH] luma: use UPower symbolic battery and refine Poster wide controls

The hand-composed battery background and percentage fill render malformed on
Nick's ultrawide greeter. Render the UPower display-device IconName through
St.Icon, as the adjacent Wi-Fi indicator does, preserving charge state and
theme ownership. Remove the unused SVG resource. Keep status controls as a
compact group and bring the wide password and submit row back into proportion.

diff --git a/data/gnome-shell-theme.gresource.xml b/data/gnome-shell-theme.gresource.xml
index 9ec73d2..96ca724 100644
--- a/data/gnome-shell-theme.gresource.xml
+++ b/data/gnome-shell-theme.gresource.xml
@@ -18,7 +18,6 @@
     <file>prairie-login-avatar.svg</file>
     <file>poster-photo-overlay.svg</file>
     <file>poster-card-glass.svg</file>
-    <file>poster-battery.svg</file>
     <file>workspace-placeholder.svg</file>
   </gresource>
 </gresources>
